    "durationMs": 411972,
    "finalText": "The URL shortener API is complete and fully verified. Here's what I built:\n\n**Stack**: Laravel 11.57 on PHP 8.3, MySQL (`bench` DB via `DB_*` env vars), scaffolded with Composer into `/workspace` (created in a temp dir and moved in, preserving `.git`).\n\n**Implementation**:\n- `links` migration: `id`, unique `code` (varchar 20), `url` text, `clicks` (unsigned bigint, default 0), timestamps\n- `LinkController` with `store`/`index`/`show`/`redirect`: manual JSON decode (content-type independent, malformed JSON → 422), URL rule requiring absolute http/https with host, code regex `^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{4,20}$`, 409 on duplicate custom code (pre-check + unique-violation fallback), atomic `increment('clicks')` on 302 redirect, `Str::random(8)` generated codes with collision retry\n- `bootstrap/app.php`: API routes registered with `apiPrefix: ''` so paths are `/links` and `/r/{code}` (no `/api` prefix), plus JSON renderers for validation 422, 404, and 405 so every error carries an `error` field\n- `start.sh`: `php artisan migrate --force`, then `exec php artisan serve --host=0.0.0.0 --port=8000 --no-reload` (I confirmed in the framework source that without `--no-reload`, `ServeCommand` strips all env vars except a small passthrough list — which is exactly the drop issue you flagged)\n- `.env` has no DB credentials (they come from the environment), `APP_DEBUG=false`; README documents startup and the API\n\n**Verification**: a 53-assertion curl suite covering every requirement passed — 201 with `clicks: 0` and URL returned unchanged, 409 duplicates, 422 for short/long/special-char/non-string codes and for missing/non-http/empty/malformed URLs, 404 JSON for unknown codes on both GET routes, 302 with exact Location, exactly-once click increments, ascending `GET /links` with `total`, and data/clicks persisting across a full server restart. Cold-start smoke test via `sh start.sh` worked, and I truncated the test rows so the harness starts with a clean table."
  }
